<catalogue id="2862-32ba-95e6-5f8e" name="Hittite Empire" revision="6" battleScribeVersion="2.03" authorName="Jono Firth" authorUrl="https://www.greatescapegames.co.uk/uploads/images/wysiwyg/home-shortcuts/coe/chariot/Hittite_Empire_March_2011.pdf" library="false" gameSystemId="c749-87c2-0d4a-5e29" gameSystemRevision="12" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <readme>Historical enemies of the Hittites include the Later Achaean/Mycenaeans, New Kingdom Egyptians, Kassite and Middle Babylonian, Mitanni, Syro-Canaanites, Middle Kingdom Assyrians and Sea Peoples.

A Hittite army must include a king or prince and at least one unit of chariots and one unit of spearmen.</readme>
